title: "actp-sheaf-cohomology: H¹ verification artifact for ACTP"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility artifact for "Sheaf Cohomology for Settlement Protocol
  Verification". Computes H¹ over the ACTP 8-state lifecycle and validates
  topological completeness on the published 2-complex.
